{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/9/449d60b2dd3f011565a57074b1b519cd8435bb5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(n+1)=\\frac{2F(n)+1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"177\" height=\"38\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/1/ef16b40a936a51c7ef5238812c2e5f7124a344dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1,2,\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbf71ac7f0aa2771e4751b9bb0c535a1ffbe2db2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(1)=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/3/a535b4f7b0e3958ca2e3b0aa9255ad496001681e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(101)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/9/4d9df4b3ebf0d2b062bfb50e6ae7ee7d51044418.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 49 \\quad \\text{(B) } 50 \\quad \\text{(C) } 51 \\quad \\text{(D) } 52 \\quad \\text{(E) } 53$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"309\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/d/b9d5797e6ec4300d41cf2152ef16bf1f29794f82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2F(n)+1}{2}=F(n)+\\frac{1}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"186\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>This means that for every single increment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> goes up from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/2663041fd2b9fbd85c85ad832f67c7a743a09c52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> will increase by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/6/616d5a21c98919a0a286960273edefb463314726.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"16\" height=\"37\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bb6fb7a3ff722532798b45607025254679e7b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> increments from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/2663041fd2b9fbd85c85ad832f67c7a743a09c52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> will increase <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/5/3d5989502bfb24b07b9970d19c42df8c1c6c6b30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\times100=50.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"108\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/0/750fb2a8e17f3781517854b71a442e7d319c5047.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(1)=2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/3/a535b4f7b0e3958ca2e3b0aa9255ad496001681e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(101)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> will equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/8/c38d3ffd91f8af85a37d45d904b5c34af9130186.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+50=\\boxed{\\text{(D)} \\ 52}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p><br />\nSolution by davidaops.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1966\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Pro